OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident stood down at
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA critical incident at a Kent hospital
OL,7,Fhas been stood down after it warned of
OL,8,Fhigh patient numbers and "extremely
OL,9,Flong" waits.
OL,11,FOn Monday, East Kent Hospitals NHS
OL,12,Ftrust urged people to stay away from
OL,13,Fthe A&E department at Ashford's William
OL,14,FHarvey Hospital (WHH) unless they had
OL,15,F"a life-threatening illness or injury"
OL,16,For were "collecting someone being
OL,17,Fdischarged".
OL,19,FBeds across its hospitals were full, it
OL,20,Fsaid, but WHH had seen "ongoing and
OL,21,Fexceptional demand" for its services.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
