OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident stood down at
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, despite downgrading the
OL,7,Fsituation on Wednesday, a trust
OL,8,Fspokesperson said WHH was "still
OL,9,Fextremely busy, with the emergency
OL,10,Fdepartment still under a lot of
OL,11,Fpressure".
